{"name": "夜上海", "name_en": "Ye Shanghai", "district": "黄浦区", "address": "黄浦区黄陂南路338号新天地北里1层", "price_avg": 270, "price_range": null, "price_sources": [{"platform": "米其林指南", "value": 270, "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/ye-shanghai"}], "signature_dishes": ["红烧肉", "本帮熏鱼", "手拆蟹粉河虾仁", "十年花雕醉翁鸡", "夜上海特色炒饭"], "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "沪菜"]], "form": "Finedining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "status": "open", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "awards": {"michelin": "入选", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/ye-shanghai"}, "phone_raw": "021-63112323", "booking_method": "电话/大众点评", "brand_group": null, "brand_confirmed": false, "scene": null, "special_tags": [], "lat": null, "lng": null, "scores": {"objective": 75, "diner": 70, "taste": 75, "endorsement": 75, "soft_ad_penalty": 0}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "十年花雕醉翁鸡酒香浸透鸡肉，肉质滑嫩，花雕香气醇厚；手拆蟹粉河虾仁，满满蟹粉搭配弹润虾仁，鲜度直接拉满；鲜肉小笼包皮薄汁足，咬开汤汁丰盈；夜上海特色炒饭颗粒分明，每一口都很入味", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=364677615", "date": "2026-08-28"}, {"quote": "夜上海海鲜毛血旺非常不错，虾球、牛百叶、大肠等配料非常丰富，辣度控制得恰到好处；红烧肉配五常大米，五花肉软糯不柴，咸甜调味恰到好处，菜品弱化了传统本帮菜的重油重甜，清爽不甜腻", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=348824400", "date": "2026-08-02"}, {"quote": "上海风味很独特，每一道上海菜都做得地地道道，点了那么多没有一道踩雷的，最推荐红烧肉，环境整体不错，对得起价位", "source": "Trip.com", "url": "https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/rest-11142907/", "date": "2026-03-30"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "Trip.com", "score": 4.8, "review_count": 238, "url": "https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/rest-11142907/"}], "negative_signals": ["部分食客认为价格偏高", "旺季需提前订位"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["新天地地标店，游客与商务宴请并存"]}, "sources": [{"title": "米其林指南 - 夜上海", "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/ye-shanghai", "type": "official_guide"}, {"title": "Trip.com - 夜上海(新天地太平湖店)", "url": "https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/rest-11142907/", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "上海市文旅推广网 - 夜上海", "url": "https://www.meet-in-shanghai.net/cn/food/night-shanghai-xintiandi-731183/", "type": "map"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "evidence_summary": "夜上海位于新天地北里石库门建筑内，是上海本帮菜FineDining的代表名店，米其林指南入选餐厅。餐厅保留老上海石库门外观，内部以西式典雅风格重新设计，米白色调干净素雅。食客评价其经典本帮菜出品地道：红烧肉软糯不柴、咸甜适中，搭配五常米饭被称为神仙CP；十年花雕醉翁鸡酒香浸透鸡肉、肉质滑嫩；手拆蟹粉河虾仁蟹粉饱满、虾仁弹润；夜上海海鲜毛血旺配料丰富、辣度温和，兼顾不能吃辣的食客。近年菜品趋势弱化传统本帮菜的重油重甜，走向清爽不腻，同时兼顾长辈口味与年轻人审美。Trip.com食客评分4.8/5（238条评价），多位食客称'每道菜都地道、没有踩雷'。人均约270元，环境适合商务宴请与家庭聚会，旺季建议提前订位。", "notes": "地址来自文旅推广网+城市吧；Trip.com商户页显示湖滨路168号无限极荟3楼(太平湖店)，可能为分店，米其林收录地址为黄陂南路338号。"}
{"name": "上海餐厅", "name_en": "Shanghai", "district": "黄浦区", "address": "黄浦区九江路555号王宝和大酒店2楼", "price_avg": 300, "price_range": null, "price_sources": [{"platform": "米其林指南", "value": 300, "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/shanghai"}], "signature_dishes": ["清蒸大闸蟹", "蟹粉拌面", "蟹粉小笼", "本帮红烧肉", "蟹粉狮子头"], "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "沪菜"]], "form": "Finedining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "status": "open", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "awards": {"michelin": "入选", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/shanghai"}, "phone_raw": "021-53965000", "booking_method": "电话", "brand_group": "王宝和", "brand_confirmed": true, "scene": null, "special_tags": ["包间"], "lat": null, "lng": null, "scores": {"objective": 72, "diner": 68, "taste": 75, "endorsement": 75, "soft_ad_penalty": 0}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "作为大闸蟹的疯狂爱好者又来打卡王宝和了，点了588元/人的大闸蟹畅享套餐，真的是放开吃，不管是公蟹还是母蟹，蟹黄蟹膏都饱满", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=255160459", "date": "2026-01-14"}, {"quote": "王宝和素有酒祖宗蟹大王之美誉，原汁原味的水煮大闸蟹一直是上海人心中的白月光，蟹粉拌面、蟹油小馄饨、蟹粉小笼、蟹粉狮子头都无限供应", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=83719959", "date": "2024-09-21"}, {"quote": "王宝和是中华老字号，以做与蟹有关的餐食闻名长三角地区，大闸蟹肉质鲜美蟹黄饱满", "source": "Trip.com", "url": "https://hk.trip.com/travel-guide/foods/shanghai-2-restaurant/city-11143013/", "date": "2026-08-06"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "Trip.com", "score": 4.6, "url": "https://hk.trip.com/travel-guide/foods/shanghai-2-restaurant/city-11143013/"}, {"platform": "携程", "score": 4.5, "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/4994255-dianping.html"}], "negative_signals": ["蟹季外菜单选择相对有限", "旺季需排队"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["秋季大闸蟹季客流高峰"]}, "sources": [{"title": "米其林指南 - 上海餐厅", "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/shanghai", "type": "official_guide"}, {"title": "Trip.com - 上海王宝和大酒店·上海餐厅", "url": "https://hk.trip.com/travel-guide/foods/shanghai-2-restaurant/city-11143013/", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "携程美食 - 上海王宝和大酒店·上海餐厅", "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/4994255-dianping.html", "type": "ugc"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "evidence_summary": "上海餐厅位于九江路555号王宝和大酒店2楼，是著名大闸蟹老字号王宝和的姐妹餐厅，米其林指南入选沪菜餐厅。餐厅以正宗本帮菜起家，尤以大闸蟹宴闻名长三角，素有'酒祖宗蟹大王'之美誉。秋季蟹季推出588元/位大闸蟹畅享套餐，水煮大闸蟹原汁原味、蟹黄饱满，蟹粉拌面、蟹油小馄饨、蟹粉小笼、蟹粉狮子头等蟹粉菜品无限供应。非蟹季亦提供经典本帮菜，主厨使用优质食材精心烹制，并自酿黄酒可供外带。Trip.com食客评分4.6/5，携程人均约276元。食客评价蟹肉鲜美、蟹黄饱满，但非蟹季菜品选择相对有限。餐厅毗邻南京路步行街，环境古色古香，适合家庭聚餐与商务宴请。", "notes": "输入原地址写'上海大酒店2楼'，经核实应为'王宝和大酒店2楼'(九江路555号)；王宝和大酒店与上海大酒店(九江路505号)为姐妹酒店但不同楼宇。电话021-53965000。"}
{"name": "利苑(徐汇)", "name_en": "Lei Garden", "district": "徐汇区", "address": "徐汇区淮海中路999号环贸iapm广场4楼401号", "price_avg": 500, "price_range": null, "price_sources": [{"platform": "米其林指南", "value": 500, "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/lei-garden-xuhui"}], "signature_dishes": ["冰烧三层肉", "流沙奶黄包", "玻璃脆皮乳鸽", "杨枝甘露", "蜜汁叉烧"], "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "粤菜"]], "form": "Finedining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "status": "open", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "awards": {"michelin": "一星", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/lei-garden-xuhui"}, "phone_raw": "021-54252283", "booking_method": "电话/大众点评", "brand_group": "利苑酒家", "brand_confirmed": true, "scene": null, "special_tags": ["包间"], "lat": null, "lng": null, "scores": {"objective": 78, "diner": 75, "taste": 80, "endorsement": 85, "soft_ad_penalty": 0}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "冰烧三层肉是我心中烧肉的标杆，小小的一块切得特别精致，皮酥肉嫩肥而不腻，三层的最佳比例口感刚刚好；奶黄流沙包也是一级棒，咬一口就会流沙的感觉特别爽", "source": "穷游", "url": "https://m.qyer.com/place/poi/V2UJYVFmBz5TZ1I-Cmk/reviews/", "date": "2023-02-04"}, {"quote": "冰烧三层肉利苑的招牌，但中规中矩没觉得比利苑别家好；蜜汁叉烧还不错多少有些腻，点一壶茶搭配比较好；不预约根本吃不到，部分菜式必须提前预约", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=356999511", "date": "2026-08-15"}, {"quote": "冰烧三层肉应了那句肥而不腻瘦而不柴，还有一层点睛的脆皮；杨枝甘露据说是他家发明的，尝了原版会更加浓郁饱满料是真的好；野菌贡菜饺刚入口是菌子的鲜然后嚼到脆甜的贡菜", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7386185964089101587", "date": "2024-06-30"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "高德", "score": 4.6, "url": null}, {"platform": "携程", "score": 4.5, "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/5031155-dianping180080563.html"}], "negative_signals": ["部分食客认为冰烧三层肉中规中矩", "蜜汁叉烧偏腻", "需提前预约否则等位"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["不预约吃不到", "招牌菜需提前预订"]}, "sources": [{"title": "米其林指南 - 利苑(徐汇)", "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/lei-garden-xuhui", "type": "official_guide"}, {"title": "携程美食 - 利苑(环贸iapm店)", "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/5031155-dianping180080563.html", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "穷游 - 利苑(环贸广场)点评", "url": "https://m.qyer.com/place/poi/V2UJYVFmBz5TZ1I-Cmk/reviews/", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "上海本地宝 - 利苑(IAPM店)", "url": "http://sh.bendibao.com/wangdian/dian/3982084.shtm", "type": "map"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "evidence_summary": "利苑徐汇分店位于淮海中路999号环贸iapm广场4楼，是香港老牌粤菜品牌利苑的上海分店之一，米其林一星餐厅，素有'粤菜黄埔军校'之称。餐厅内部设计独特，从中央柱子向天花板延伸呈现树形姿态环抱大厅。招牌冰烧三层肉皮酥肉嫩、肥而不腻，三层比例精准，被食客称为烧肉标杆；流沙奶黄包咬一口即流沙，奶香浓郁；玻璃脆皮乳鸽多汁配芥末酱别有风味；杨枝甘露据传为利苑首创，原版浓郁饱满。部分食客认为冰烧三层肉'中规中矩'、蜜汁叉烧偏腻，但总体出品稳定是利苑的标签。不预约基本吃不到，部分菜式需提前预订。高德评分4.6，人均约313-500元。", "notes": "地址经米其林官方+高德交叉确认为淮海中路999号环贸iapm L4-401；电话021-54252283(高德)。品牌在库id=493(浦东国金店)，此为徐汇iapm分店。"}
{"name": "台城镂月", "name_en": "Toi Sihng Lauh Yuht", "district": "黄浦区", "address": "黄浦区徐家汇路268号凯德晶萃广场5楼", "price_avg": 300, "price_range": null, "price_sources": [{"platform": "米其林指南", "value": 300, "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/toi-sihng-lauh-yuht"}], "signature_dishes": ["台山水步黄鳝饭", "汶村五味鹅", "十年陈皮蛋挞", "鹅肝叉烧菠萝包", "古法龟苓膏"], "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "粤菜", "台山菜"]], "form": "Finedining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "status": "open", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "awards": {"michelin": "入选", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/toi-sihng-lauh-yuht"}, "phone_raw": null, "booking_method": "大众点评/电话", "brand_group": null, "brand_confirmed": false, "scene": null, "special_tags": [], "lat": null, "lng": null, "scores": {"objective": 70, "diner": 78, "taste": 78, "endorsement": 70, "soft_ad_penalty": 0}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "招牌汶村五味鹅完美复刻老家味道，五味平衡柔和，鹅肉紧实入味；非遗台山水步黄鳝饭用料实在，鳝丝鲜嫩，锅底锅巴是整锅精华；鹅肝叉烧菠萝包脑洞十足，咸甜油脂碰撞特别惊艳；十年陈皮蛋挞用料考究，正宗新会老陈皮香气浓郁", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=352652630", "date": "2026-08-08"}, {"quote": "台山水步黄鳝饭一掀开锅盖就香迷糊了，锅巴焦脆得咬起来咔嚓响，鳝肉滑嫩入味，拌着饭吃根本停不下来；汶村五味鹅酱汁浓郁酸甜口，鹅肉嫩而不柴配米饭绝了；陈皮蛋挞酥到掉渣，内馅带着淡淡陈皮香", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=348313729", "date": "2026-08-01"}, {"quote": "电饭煲狂飙鸡，不加水只用粗盐和五指毛桃腌制，鸡皮晶莹剔透、鸡肉入口嫩滑带着淡淡椰香；台山水步腊味煲仔饭是台山非遗名菜，黄鳝和我手指差不多粗，加入陈皮丝和姜丝爆炒，底下的饭脆脆的", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=180948195", "date": "2025-08-06"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "携程", "score": 4.7, "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=352652630"}], "negative_signals": ["商场店环境一般", "部分食客认为人均偏高"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["台山土著带路推荐", "网红打卡热度高"]}, "sources": [{"title": "米其林指南 - 台城镂月", "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/toi-sihng-lauh-yuht", "type": "official_guide"}, {"title": "携程笔记 - 台城镂月食客评价", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=352652630", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "携程笔记 - 台城镂月黄鳝饭", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=180948195", "type": "ugc"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "evidence_summary": "台城镂月位于徐家汇路268号凯德晶萃广场5楼，是魔都首家台山广府菜餐厅，米其林指南入选。餐厅将台山非遗美食带入上海，环境清新素雅还原台山风貌。招牌台山水步黄鳝饭为非遗名菜，现杀黄鳝拆丝与陈皮姜丝爆炒，用鳝骨汤焖煮台山丝苗米，端上桌滋滋作响，锅底焦脆锅巴被多位食客称为'整锅精华'。汶村五味鹅咸酸甜鲜辛五层风味浸透鹅肉，肉质软嫩不柴，酱汁拌饭能炫两碗。鹅肝叉烧菠萝包创意十足，咸甜油脂碰撞；十年新会陈皮蛋挞陈皮磨粉入蛋液，酥皮一碰掉渣。电饭煲狂飙鸡以粗盐五指毛桃腌制，鸡皮晶莹、鸡肉嫩滑带椰香。古法龟苓膏配陈皮百花蜜，苦中带甜解腻。食客评价多为台山本地人认证，称其'保留原汁原味台山风味'。人均约150-300元，性价比在米其林店中突出。", "notes": "地址经多篇携程笔记交叉确认为徐家汇路268号凯德晶萃5楼(马当路站)；菜系为台山菜(广府菜分支)，非 generic 粤菜。电话未在公开渠道获取，留空待补。"}
{"name": "瑰禧", "name_en": "Blossom", "district": "静安区", "address": "静安区南京西路1266号恒隆广场5楼", "price_avg": 300, "price_range": null, "price_sources": [{"platform": "米其林指南", "value": 300, "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/blossom-1246455"}], "signature_dishes": ["卤水四点金", "冻马友鱼饭", "招牌牛杂煲", "酸汤鱼", "姜薯芋泥"], "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "粤菜", "潮州菜"]], "form": "Finedining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "status": "open", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "awards": {"michelin": "必比登", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/blossom-1246455"}, "phone_raw": null, "booking_method": "大众点评/电话", "brand_group": "菁禧荟", "brand_confirmed": true, "scene": null, "special_tags": [], "lat": null, "lng": null, "scores": {"objective": 72, "diner": 76, "taste": 76, "endorsement": 72, "soft_ad_penalty": 0}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "招牌牛杂煲绝非浓油赤酱的厚重，汤底清澈却滋味醇厚，牛杂处理得干净软糯；红薯粉辣烧膏蟹创意十足，红薯粉吸饱了膏蟹的鲜与微辣的汁，软糯鲜香蟹膏丰腴；卤水四点金选用狮头鹅珍贵的掌心部位，卤香深入骨髓皮弹肉嫩", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=264680410", "date": "2026-02-07"}, {"quote": "冻马友鱼饭第一口就懂了什么叫鲜到眉心一跳，鱼皮凝着薄薄的鱼冻像裹了水晶衣，筷子轻挑蒜瓣肉颤巍巍散开，海盐吊出回甘；卤水四点金部位胶糯粘唇轻轻一抿骨肉就散了架；招牌牛杂煲带着沙茶香的锅气端上来", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=344101115", "date": "2026-07-26"}, {"quote": "很推荐春天的蚕豆嫩得连壳都可以一起吃；湛江果园鸡非常有性价比而且鸡有鸡味肉有肉香；鱼饭也是我经常爱点的菜，虽然叫鱼饭但它并没有米饭，是潮汕那边的习俗", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7629303973593972325", "date": "2026-04-16"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "携程", "score": 4.6, "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=264680410"}], "negative_signals": ["恒隆商场店空间不大", "部分食客认为副牌出品不如菁禧荟精致"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["菁禧荟副牌，性价比路线吸引年轻食客"]}, "sources": [{"title": "米其林指南 - 瑰禧", "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/blossom-1246455", "type": "official_guide"}, {"title": "携程笔记 - 瑰禧恒隆店食客评价", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=264680410", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "抖音 - 瑰禧探店", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7629303973593972325", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "新浪 - 瑰禧恒隆广场新开餐厅食评", "url": "https://www.sina.cn/news/detail/5245106073898427.html", "type": "media"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "evidence_summary": "瑰禧位于南京西路恒隆广场5楼，是米其林二星潮州菜名店菁禧荟的副牌，2025年末开业即获米其林必比登推介。相比母店菁禧荟，瑰禧菜品价格更亲民、适应面更广，人均100-400元丰俭由人。招牌卤水四点金取狮头鹅掌心理部位，卤香深入骨髓、胶糯粘唇；冻马友鱼饭以鱼冻裹蒜瓣肉，海盐吊出回甘，是潮汕鱼饭传统做法；招牌牛杂煲汤底清澈却醇厚，带沙香锅气，牛肚牛筋金钱肚配萝卜吸满汤汁。红薯粉辣烧膏蟹创意融合，粉吸蟹鲜；酸汤鱼以潮汕酸菜自然发酵，皖鱼片柔脆滑嫩。甜品姜薯芋泥细腻绵密。食客评价其菜品比菁禧荟更便宜、日常便饭友好，味道'会常来'。春季蚕豆嫩到连壳可食，湛江果园鸡性价比高。", "notes": "地址经携程笔记+新浪食评确认为南京西路恒隆广场5楼；系菁禧荟(杜建青团队)副牌。电话未公开获取，留空。菜系为潮州菜。"}
{"name": "海味观(静安)", "name_en": "Hai Wei Guan", "district": "静安区", "address": "静安区康定路18号", "price_avg": 300, "price_range": null, "price_sources": [{"platform": "米其林指南", "value": 300, "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/hai-wei-guan"}], "signature_dishes": ["黑松露脆皮烤鸡", "海派熏鲈鱼", "茅台百草醉蟹", "响油鳝丝", "松茸野菌炖鸽蛋"], "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "沪菜", "海鲜"]], "form": "Finedining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "status": "open", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "awards": {"michelin": "入选", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/hai-wei-guan"}, "phone_raw": "021-62569956", "booking_method": "电话/大众点评", "brand_group": null, "brand_confirmed": false, "scene": null, "special_tags": ["包间", "需预订"], "lat": null, "lng": null, "scores": {"objective": 76, "diner": 74, "taste": 76, "endorsement": 72, "soft_ad_penalty": 0}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "先喝下松茸野菌炖鸽蛋，里面是鸽子蛋，鲜是菌鲜慢慢回味；绣球菌拌北极贝酱拌完之后冰凉的鲜很弹脆；黑松露脆皮烤鸡是招牌也是黑松露陈皮酥牛肉，摆盘有米其林那种感觉", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7665583095797803846", "date": "2026-07-23"}, {"quote": "第一道是茅台百草醉蟹，没有太重的白酒味道但整个滋味蛮浓郁，选用二两半雄蟹；法式清酒鹅肝份量不多但切得蛮大，中间微微带粉，咬一口香滑软糯带一点点酒香", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/6901255319452749071", "date": "2020-12-01"}, {"quote": "汤品是茉莉海蚌清鸡汤，清甜的海蚌肉伴着清新的鸡汤入口还能品到丝丝茉莉香气；前菜海派鲜炸熏鱼色泽金黄表面焦脆，既保留传统老上海风味还融入新海派做法，一咬就爆汁", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7289760425569307967", "date": "2023-10-14"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "高德", "score": 4.7, "url": null}, {"platform": "携程", "score": 4.5, "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/15944067-dianping175205914.html"}], "negative_signals": ["黑松露脆皮烤鸡需提前预订", "洋房店空间有限"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["十年洋房本帮菜", "黑松露系列需预订"]}, "sources": [{"title": "米其林指南 - 海味观(静安)", "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/hai-wei-guan", "type": "official_guide"}, {"title": "携程美食 - 海味观(康定花园店)", "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/15944067-dianping175205914.html", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "抖音 - 海味观十年洋房探店", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7665583095797803846", "type": "ugc"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "evidence_summary": "海味观(静安)位于康定路18号，藏身一栋白色立面的两层洋房中，是新海派本帮菜代表，米其林指南入选。餐厅以黑松露系列为特色，招牌黑松露脆皮烤鸡需提前预订，外皮酥脆内里弹嫩；黑松露陈皮酥牛肉摆盘精致。茅台百草醉蟹以花雕酒和飞天茅台腌制，酒味浓郁但不刺鼻，选用二两半雄蟹；法式清酒鹅肝中间微粉、香滑糯带酒香。茉莉海蚌清鸡汤清甜带茉莉花香；海派熏鲈鱼色泽金黄焦脆，一咬爆汁，在传统老上海熏鱼基础上融入新海派做法。松茸野菌炖鸽蛋菌鲜回味悠长；绣球菌拌北极贝弹脆冰凉。高德评分4.7，携程人均约256元。食客评价其为'十年洋房本帮菜'，适合约会聚餐洽谈。", "notes": "地址经米其林官方+高德+携程交叉确认为康定路18号；电话021-62569956。黑松露脆皮烤鸡为预订菜。"}
{"name": "上海总会", "name_en": "The Shanghai Club", "district": "静安区", "address": "静安区南京西路789号兴业太古汇4层", "price_avg": 400, "price_range": null, "price_sources": [{"platform": "米其林指南", "value": 400, "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/shanghai-club"}], "signature_dishes": ["核桃酱鸭方", "酒香蒸鲥鱼配面盏", "四宝炖花胶", "芝麻菜卷肥牛", "老上海咸鸡"], "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "江浙菜"]], "form": "Finedining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "status": "open", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "awards": {"michelin": "入选", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/shanghai-club"}, "phone_raw": "021-52998660", "booking_method": "电话/大众点评", "brand_group": "苏浙汇", "brand_confirmed": true, "scene": null, "special_tags": ["包间"], "lat": null, "lng": null, "scores": {"objective": 74, "diner": 72, "taste": 74, "endorsement": 75, "soft_ad_penalty": 0}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "酒香蒸鲥鱼配面盏，鲥鱼鳞片都不用去的，酒香完全渗入鱼肉鲜嫩到筷子一夹就碎，配的吸饱汤汁的面盏才是灵魂；核桃酱鸭方是本帮酱鸭的升级版，鸭肉酥软带核桃香，酱汁甜度刚好不齁一口一块停不下来", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=195210877", "date": "2025-09-07"}, {"quote": "餐厅宽敞大气时尚简约装修，配上并不很年轻的服务员亲切的上海话好感度拉满；点了大煮干丝、鸭丝春卷、佛跳墙、葱椒炝明虾片、虾籽虾仁双虾炒鱼丝，还有超级嫩的草头", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7487138507907960123", "date": "2025-03-29"}, {"quote": "上海总会是苏浙汇旗下，以改良本帮菜闻名，位于兴业太古汇顶层，环境安静优雅很有格调，菜品数量不多但品质高味道好，糖醋类菜品出色", "source": "Trip.com", "url": "https://www.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/shanghai-club-34386781/", "date": "2026-09-24"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "Trip.com", "score": 4.5, "url": "https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/shanghai-club-hkritaikoo-hui-34386781/"}], "negative_signals": ["商场店无外滩景观", "午市点心时段人多"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["苏浙汇高端线，捧场客众多建议预座"]}, "sources": [{"title": "米其林指南 - 上海总会", "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/shanghai-club", "type": "official_guide"}, {"title": "Trip.com - 上海总会(兴业太古汇店)", "url": "https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/shanghai-club-hkritaikoo-hui-34386781/", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "携程美食 - 上海总会(兴业太古汇店)", "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/16993975-dianping203019538.html", "type": "ugc"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "evidence_summary": "上海总会位于南京西路789号兴业太古汇4层，是知名江浙菜品牌苏浙汇旗下的高档线，米其林指南入选。餐厅以老上海风格设计，设多个独立包厢，空间宽敞大气、时尚简约，服务员操着亲切上海话。菜单涵盖经典上海菜肴及核桃酱鸭方等少见手工菜式，亦提供海鲜及时令美食，午市有广式点心。招牌酒香蒸鲥鱼配面盏，鲥鱼鳞不去、酒香渗入鱼肉，配吸饱汤汁的面盏为灵魂；核桃酱鸭方为本帮酱鸭升级版，鸭肉酥软带核桃香。四宝炖花胶、芝麻菜卷肥牛、老上海咸鸡、大煮干丝、鸭丝春卷等均获食客好评。Trip.com评分4.5/5，食客称环境安静优雅、菜品品质高。人均约300-400元，适合商务宴请与家庭聚会，捧场客众多建议提前订座。", "notes": "经Trip.com/携程确认为兴业太古汇店(南京西路789号4层)，非外滩；district从原黄浦区更正为静安区。电话021-52998660。苏浙汇旗下高端品牌。"}
{"name": "馨源楼", "name_en": "Xin Yuan Lou", "district": "黄浦区", "address": "黄浦区瑞金二路118号瑞金洲际酒店4号楼", "price_avg": 300, "price_range": null, "price_sources": [{"platform": "米其林指南", "value": 300, "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/xin-yuan-lou"}], "signature_dishes": ["石库门熏鱼", "老火靓汤", "橄榄虾肉雪茄", "脆皮烧鹅", "盐焗鸡"], "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "粤菜"]], "form": "Finedining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "status": "open", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "awards": {"michelin": "入选", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/xin-yuan-lou"}, "phone_raw": "021-64725222", "booking_method": "电话(转7340)/酒店预订", "brand_group": null, "brand_confirmed": false, "scene": null, "special_tags": ["包间", "洋房"], "lat": null, "lng": null, "scores": {"objective": 73, "diner": 70, "taste": 74, "endorsement": 73, "soft_ad_penalty": 0}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "青酱脆皮小青龙虾肉裹粉高温油炸外壳蓬松酥脆内里弹嫩，底部铺垫细腻青酱衬托风味；柠檬叶底咖喱鱼盘底铺垫柠檬叶去腥增香巧妙中和咖喱厚重油脂；脆皮茄子分段高温油炸外皮裹糊炸至酥脆定型", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=319491215", "date": "2026-06-10"}, {"quote": "馨源楼常年稳拿米其林餐盘奖，从封神的老火靓汤到顶配的海鲜硬菜每一道都是老钱私宴标配；瑞金宾馆前身是英商玛丽斯私家花园，馨源楼所在主楼1924年落成", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=320340525", "date": "2026-06-12"}, {"quote": "石库门熏鱼首创两次炸制实现外层口感酥脆鱼肉细嫩多汁，腌制三小时的新鲜草鱼；馨源楼擅长经典本帮菜和粤菜，2013年后鼓励打造新式菜肴", "source": "今日头条/新民网", "url": "http://m.toutiao.com/group/6684125241871958540/", "date": "2019-04-26"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "携程", "score": 4.5, "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/5028497-dianping170980321.html"}], "negative_signals": ["酒店内位置较隐蔽", "秋季蘑菇菜单需预订"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["百年英式庄园私宴氛围", "老钱风格宴请"]}, "sources": [{"title": "米其林指南 - 馨源楼", "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/xin-yuan-lou", "type": "official_guide"}, {"title": "携程美食 - 馨源楼", "url": "https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/5028497-dianping170980321.html", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "上海市文旅推广网 - 馨源楼", "url": "https://www.meet-in-shanghai.net/cn/food/xinyuan-building-645600/", "type": "map"}, {"title": "新民网 - 馨源楼老经典新惊艳", "url": "http://m.toutiao.com/group/6684125241871958540/", "type": "media"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "evidence_summary": "馨源楼坐落于瑞金二路118号瑞金洲际酒店花园内一幢1920年代三层红砖西式洋楼中，距百年历史，是上海最具氛围的粤菜餐厅之一。楼内陈设古董家具、壁炉与中国艺术品，分两层含酒吧、酒廊、茶室及多间包厢，老钱风格浓厚。菜单以粤菜为主兼收本帮菜，招牌石库门熏鱼首创两次炸制工艺，外层酥脆鱼肉细嫩多汁；老火靓汤被食客称为'封神'之作。橄榄虾肉雪茄、石锅京葱银鳕鱼、脆皮烧鹅、盐焗鸡、蜜汁叉烧均为推荐。近年创新菜如青酱脆皮小青龙、柠檬叶底咖喱鱼、脆皮茄子获好评。携程人均约286元。食客评价其环境优雅、出品稳定，适合私宴与家庭聚会，秋季蘑菇菜单需提前预订。", "notes": "地址经米其林官方+文旅网+携程确认为瑞金二路118号瑞金洲际酒店4号楼；电话021-64725222转7340(总机转餐厅)。菜系粤菜兼本帮。"}
{"name": "川粤海棠(长宁)", "name_en": "Chuan Yue Hai Tang", "district": "长宁区", "address": "长宁区金钟路788号上海荟聚4楼A01号", "price_avg": 300, "price_range": null, "price_sources": [{"platform": "米其林指南", "value": 300, "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/chuan-yue-hai-tang-changning"}], "signature_dishes": ["贡椒脆皮小刀鸭", "百年传承回锅肉", "三葱爆炒吊龙", "宫保龙虾球", "毛血旺"], "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "川菜", "粤菜"]], "form": "Finedining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "status": "open", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "awards": {"michelin": "入选", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/chuan-yue-hai-tang-changning"}, "phone_raw": null, "booking_method": "大众点评/电话", "brand_group": "粤海棠", "brand_confirmed": true, "scene": null, "special_tags": ["包间"], "lat": null, "lng": null, "scores": {"objective": 70, "diner": 72, "taste": 73, "endorsement": 70, "soft_ad_penalty": 0}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "贡椒小刀鸭是招牌菜，宜良小刀鸭做法有点像烤乳鸽，皮脆肉嫩带一点点微微的椒麻香；三葱爆炒吊龙这道要趁热吃，川粤融合把四川的麻辣鲜香以更细腻高级的技法融入粤菜的清淡鲜美", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=341347455", "date": "2026-07-22"}, {"quote": "百年传承回锅肉是川菜名片，五花肉薄片大豆豉鲜香而酱味十足，再佐以青蒜苗肥而不腻；由米其林潮汕菜星厨张一峰、川菜星厨高军、粤菜星厨何柱君联手打造", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=104034680", "date": "2024-12-02"}, {"quote": "贡椒脆皮小刀鸭点了自己喜欢的菜每道都特别精致味道好；清蒸笋壳鱼鱼肉细嫩特别鲜；毛血旺非常棒配料很丰富连鲍鱼都有；爆炒皇后腰花麻辣特别浓味", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7615813671767664378", "date": "2026-03-11"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "携程", "score": 4.6, "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=341347455"}], "negative_signals": ["商场店环境一般", "包房有10%服务费"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["米其林推荐餐厅姐妹店", "前湾荟聚商圈新开"]}, "sources": [{"title": "米其林指南 - 川粤海棠(长宁)", "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/chuan-yue-hai-tang-changning", "type": "official_guide"}, {"title": "携程笔记 - 川粤海棠食客评价", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=341347455", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "抖音 - 川粤海棠荟聚店探店", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7615813671767664378", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "上海长宁 - 2026米其林指南上榜餐厅", "url": "http://m.toutiao.com/group/7628477335708107307/", "type": "media"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "evidence_summary": "川粤海棠(长宁)位于金钟路788号上海荟聚4楼A01，是米其林推荐餐厅粤海棠的姐妹品牌，主打川粤融合菜，2026米其林指南入选。餐厅由三位星级主厨联手打造——潮汕菜星厨张一峰、川菜星厨高军、粤菜星厨何柱君，将四川的麻辣鲜香以细腻高级技法融入粤菜的清淡鲜美。招牌贡椒脆皮小刀鸭取宜良小刀鸭，做法似烤乳鸽，皮脆肉嫩带微椒麻香；百年传承回锅肉五花肉薄片、豆豉酱香配青蒜苗，肥而不腻；三葱爆炒吊龙趁热食用。宫保龙虾球Q弹裹宫保酱汁酸甜带麻；毛血旺配料丰富甚至含鲍鱼；清蒸笋壳鱼细嫩鲜美；爆炒腰花麻辣浓郁。包房环境雅致，收10%服务费。食客评价适合聚会宴请，川粤融合路线在米其林店中独具特色。", "notes": "地址经米其林官方+长宁媒体确认为金钟路788号荟聚4楼；菜系为川菜+粤菜融合(非单一川菜)。系粤海棠姐妹店。电话未公开获取。"}
{"name": "外滩·林家一", "name_en": "Lin Family of One the Bund", "district": "黄浦区", "address": "黄浦区南京东路123号外滩中央商场4楼整层", "price_avg": 400, "price_range": null, "price_sources": [{"platform": "米其林指南", "value": 400, "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/lin-family-of-one-the-bund"}], "signature_dishes": ["茅酒蒸梭子蟹", "花胶黄鱼羹", "蟹粉豆腐", "黄鱼佛跳墙"], "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "台州菜"]], "form": "Finedining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "status": "open", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "awards": {"michelin": "入选", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/lin-family-of-one-the-bund"}, "phone_raw": "021-63277779", "booking_method": "电话/大众点评", "brand_group": null, "brand_confirmed": false, "scene": null, "special_tags": ["包间"], "lat": null, "lng": null, "scores": {"objective": 76, "diner": 76, "taste": 76, "endorsement": 75, "soft_ad_penalty": 0}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "茅台酒蒸梭子蟹，茅台和梭子蟹这样的搭配还是头一次见，蟹肉的清甜渗透了茅台酒的酒香，很好；餐厅在百年老建筑里旋转楼梯网纱吊灯，环境高端典雅又浪漫", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=102939467", "date": "2024-11-28"}, {"quote": "蟹粉豆腐用的是白水洋柴火豆腐，只用盐卤点浆不加石膏，豆香特别醇厚越炖越鲜；浇头是实打实五到六只蟹拆出来的和豆腐完美融合；外滩蝉联4年米其林，父母吃完不心疼", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7685237534251257714", "date": "2026-09-14"}, {"quote": "作为一家专做融合台州菜的新晋米其林上榜餐厅，TA家在东海有自己的渔场每天新鲜海鲜直送，店址选在繁华的南东外滩中央广场4楼整层", "source": "携程", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=99691642", "date": "2024-11-16"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "Trip.com", "score": 5.0, "url": "https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/the-bundlin-jia-one-central-mall-branch-130879701/"}], "negative_signals": ["Trip.com评论数较少", "外滩商圈价格偏高"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["东海自有渔场直供", "蝉联米其林多年"]}, "sources": [{"title": "米其林指南 - 外滩·林家一", "url": "https://guide.michelin.com/cn/zh_CN/shanghai-region/shanghai/restaurants/lin-family-of-one-the-bund", "type": "official_guide"}, {"title": "Trip.com - 外滩·林家一(中央商场店)", "url": "https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/the-bundlin-jia-one-central-mall-branch-130879701/", "type": "ugc"}, {"title": "携程笔记 - 外滩林家一食客评价", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=102939467", "type": "ugc"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-24", "evidence_summary": "外滩·林家一位于南京东路123号外滩中央商场4楼整层，是专做台州菜的米其林指南入选餐厅，连续多年上榜。餐厅在东海自有渔场，每天新鲜海鲜直送上海。招牌茅酒蒸梭子蟹以茅台与梭子蟹同蒸，蟹肉清甜渗透茅台酒香，被多位食客称为'扛鼎之作'；花胶黄鱼羹为台州海鲜代表；蟹粉豆腐用白水洋柴火豆腐(盐卤点浆不加石膏)，配五到六只现拆蟹粉，豆香醇厚越炖越鲜。黄鱼佛跳墙以台州灵魂黄鱼配海参，鱼肉蒜瓣式裂开入口醇厚。餐厅占据百年老建筑整层，旋转楼梯与网纱吊灯营造高端典雅氛围，适合商务宴请与家庭聚会。Trip.com评分5.0/5，食客称在外滩吃米其林台州菜性价比突出。电话021-63277779。", "notes": "地址经米其林官方+Trip.com确认为南京东路123号外滩中央商场4楼；电话021-63277779。菜系台州菜。"}
